 },
 "description": "Update an editable newsletter draft or future scheduled newsletter. Changing message content, presentation, or audience returns a scheduled newsletter to draft and clears scheduled_at; inspect the returned status, send a new test, and schedule again. Name, feed link, and send-window changes can keep the schedule. Paragraph, quote, callout, list-item, and column bodies accept text or sanitized inline HTML. body_text alone updates the plain-text override when blocks exist. Sending and sent newsletters cannot be edited. Concurrent saves return conflict (409). styled applies Shipmail's email theme. plain preserves HTML without injected styles, width, or centering. track_engagement turns open and click tracking on or off for this issue.",
